<title>USA: PECO Pa. Peach Bottom 2 nuke at 17 pct - NRC.</title>
<headline>PECO Pa. Peach Bottom 2 nuke at 17 pct - NRC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PECO Energy Co's 1,100 megawatt (MW) Peach Bottom 2 nuclear unit, shut late Tuesday after a turbine trip, has restarted and is operating at about 17 percent power, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission said in its Friday morning report.</p>
<p>The unit, located in Delta, Pennsylvania, automatically shut Tuesday due to an electrical problem with the turbine generator.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
</text>
